    <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#d8be82;font-size:13px;
                      line-height:18px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-bottom:7px;">
            IMPORTANT REGISTRATION INFORMATION
          </div>
          <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;
                      line-height:1.6;">
            This initial invitation intentionally does not contain an access code. Each newsroom must first complete the initial registration using its official media organisation details and official newsroom email address. After successful registration, the secure system issues a unique invitation reference and personal access code assigned specifically to that newsroom. Those credentials open the complete accreditation form.
          </div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
<div style="font-size:16px;line-height:22px;color:#081a33;font-weight:800;margin:22px 0 10px;">WHAT TO CLICK — IN THIS ORDER</div>
