<tr><td style="padding:0 30px 12px;">
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#263247;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 16px;">THE CODE is more than the title of an event. It is the code name for a long-developed business architecture, an international acquisition process and the moment at which GNK DINAMO Ltd. Group formally reveals and activates a new global group headquartered in New York.</p>

    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
           style="background:#f7f2e7;border-left:5px solid #c6a15b;margin:18px 0;">
      <tr>
        <td style="padding:18px 20px;">
          <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#081a33;font-size:13px;
                      line-height:18px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;margin-bottom:7px;">
            THIS IS NOT THE ACQUISITION OF A SINGLE COMPANY.
          </div>
          <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#263247;font-size:14px;
                      